{"id":"vod_bf_13071","vodId":"13071","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"黑之契约者2：流星的双子","name_cn":"黑之契约者2：流星的双子","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-14/f00ffc7bfd12fc134b3f746f89a09e05.jpg"},"summary":"十年前，东京出现了一个不能解释的领域。从那片领域走出的人获得了一种特殊的超能力——可以随意夺取他们的性命。却如恶魔般从此失去了梦与心。那片神秘的区域被叫做地狱门，而那些因此获取超能力的人被叫做契约者。美国的CIA，英国的MI6，日本的警视厅统统对神秘的地狱门进行了调查研究，甚至那个庞大的神秘组织潘多拉也开展行动，妄图消灭契约者们。知道真相的契约者们则团结在一起进行对抗。而另一方面，有着“黑之死神”之名的黑（木内秀信 配音）接受命令执行着组织的任务，同时也一直在寻找5年前失踪的妹妹。在执行任务的过程中黑偶遇之前的恋人琥珀（川上伦子 配音），发现眼前此人似乎隐藏着一些不为人知的秘密。　　究竟黑会不会知道琥珀真正的身份？他和妹妹是否能重逢？而人类和契约者的情况会如何发展？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动作,动画,情,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 02:55:38","classic":true,"classicRank":46,"franchise":"黑之契约者","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/heizhiqiyuezhe2liuxingdeshuangzi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/heizhiqiyuezhe2liuxingdeshuangzi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/heizhiqiyuezhe2liuxingdeshuangzi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/heizhiqiyuezhe2liuxingdeshuangzi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/heizhiqiyuezhe2liuxingdeshuangzi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/heizhiqiyuezhe2liuxingdeshuangzi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/heizhiqiyuezhe2liuxingdeshuangzi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/heizhiqiyuezhe2liuxingdeshuangzi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/heizhiqiyuezhe2liuxingdeshuangzi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/heizhiqiyuezhe2liuxingdeshuangzi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.d